# The import has no BallShadow image, so the tap ball had no shadow. The
# four night shadows use the shadow of the remake (SSRBallShadow), each
# faint, and the app puts the group under the ball (TapBallShadows).
- Rect:(-1000,925) ref:TapBallNightShadow
+ Rect:(-1000,925) ref:TapBallShadows
- Draw:(BallShadow,0,0,200,50) ref:TapBallNightShadow
+ Draw:(SSRBallShadow,0,0,260,60,,#FFFFFF70) ref:TapBallNightShadow
